    LLM: '1. Deal 13 each (4 decks = 208 cards). 2. Each player has personal trump (one suit). 3. Left of dealer leads. 4. Follow suit or trump. 5. Trump beats non-trump. 6. Build Calypsos (complete A-K of your trump) from won tricks. 7. Surplus trump cards in tricks = 10 pts each at game end. 8. 4 deals; first to target wins.',
